## Route Constraints (v2.37.0+)

```go
// Type constraints
app.Get("/user/:id<int>", getUser)               // Only integers
app.Get("/active/:status<bool>", filterByStatus) // true/false only
app.Get("/order/:uuid<guid>", getOrder)          // UUID format
app.Get("/price/:amount<float>", getByPrice)     // Float numbers

// Length constraints
app.Get("/code/:value<minLen(5)>", handler)      // Min 5 chars
app.Get("/code/:value<maxLen(10)>", handler)     // Max 10 chars
app.Get("/code/:value<len(8)>", handler)         // Exactly 8 chars

// Numeric constraints
app.Get("/age/:value<min(18)>", handler)         // >= 18
app.Get("/age/:value<max(100)>", handler)        // <= 100
app.Get("/age/:value<range(18,65)>", handler)    // Between 18-65

// String & DateTime
app.Get("/name/:value<alpha>", handler)                      // Letters only
app.Get("/date/:value<datetime(2006-01-02)>", handler)       // Date format

// Regex
app.Get("/code/:value<regex(^[A-Z]{3}\\d{3}$)>", handler)   // ABC123 format

// Multiple constraints (semicolon-separated)
app.Get("/product/:id<int;min(1);max(9999)>", getProduct)
```

