## Static Files

```go
// Serve files from ./public directory
app.Static("/", "./public")

// Serve with prefix
app.Static("/static", "./assets")
// URL: /static/css/style.css → File: ./assets/css/style.css

// With configuration
app.Static("/files", "./storage", fiber.Static{
    Compress:      true,
    ByteRange:     true,
    Browse:        false, // Disable directory browsing
    Index:         "index.html",
    CacheDuration: 24 * time.Hour,
    MaxAge:        3600,
})
```

